ns, planning, and finding the right next step.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/learn">See resources →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-primary">storefront</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Free MSME Directory Listing</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Create a profile so customers, suppliers, and potential partners can discover your products or services.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/directory">Browse the directory →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-secondary">video_camera_front</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Free Webinars &amp; Meetups</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Learn from practitioners, join community conversations, and leave with practical next steps.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/events">View events →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-tertiary-container">handshake</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Peer Sourcing &amp; Bayanihan</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Find trusted referrals, supplier leads, shared opportunities, and people who understand the local journey.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/directory">Connect with Ka-FLAME →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-tertiary-container">sell</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Affiliate Product Marketing</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Discover and promote FLAME PH brand partners, branded products, signature items, and personalized products by FLAME PH.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/flameph-merchs">Explore affiliate products →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-primary">location_city</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Become a Chapter Leader</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Establish a FLAME PH city or municipal chapter in your area and build a stronger local MSME network.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/get-involved#community">Lead a local chapter →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-secondary">record_voice_over</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Volunteer as a Resource Speaker</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Help Filipino MSMEs learn through FLAME PH events, workshops, trainings, seminars, webinars, expos, conventions, annual awards, and other activities.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/get-involved#mentor">Offer to speak →</a></article><article class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-primary">engineering</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Volunteer Professional Services</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Help strengthen FLAME PH digital platforms and provide tax compliance, bookkeeping, advertising, accounting, and related professional support.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-primary" href="/get-involved#partners">Offer professional support →</a></article></div></div></section>
