        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Searchable listing</strong> in the official National MSME Directory<br><em>(Libreng listing sa National MSME Directory para madaling mahanap ng mga mamimili at katuwang)</em></span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Ka-FLAME AI (Basic Tier):</strong> 20 startup, pricing, or permit queries every single month in Taglish<br><em>(20 libreng AI queries buwan-buwan para sa permits, diskarte sa presyo, at payo sa negosyo)</em></span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Downloadable MSME Toolkits:</strong> Cash flow template, daily inventory log, BIR simple receipt guide<br><em>(Libreng templates para sa cash flow, imbentaryo, at simpleng gabay sa BIR resibo)</em></span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Weekly MSME Bulletin:</strong> Direct updates on DTI grants, DOST setups, micro-financing loans &amp; tax dates<br><em>(Lingguhang balita ukol sa DTI grants, ayuda, pautang sa negosyo, at mga deadlines)</em></span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Open educational webinars:</strong> Bi-weekly virtual masterclasses, legal clinics, and townhalls<br><em>(Bawat dalawang linggong webinar, legal advice clinic, at talakayan ng komunidad)</em></span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">check_circle</span><span><strong class="text-on-surface">Seamless one-tap upgrade option</strong> whenever your enterprise is ready for POS &amp; global trade<br><em>(Madaling mag-upgrade sa POS at iba pang advanced tools kapag handa nang lumawak ang negosyo)</em></span></li>`;
    grid.appendChild(plan);

    const idImage = idPanel.querySelector('img');
    if (idImage) idImage.classList.add('max-h-[310px]', 'object-contain');
});
